# Codex 0.154 hook trust hashes of plugins/codex/hooks/codex.json (D98), one line
# per hook: "<event key label>:<group>:<handler>  <hash>", the tail of its trust key
# [hooks.state."precinto@<marketplace>:hooks/codex.json:<event>:<group>:<handler>"].
# Codex runs a hook only when that entry's trusted_hash equals the hash below; any
# other stored hash is "Modified" and the hook does not run
# (codex-rs/hooks/src/engine/discovery.rs hook_trust_status). HooksTrusted reports
# a home trusted only for these hashes.
#
# Derivation (rust-v0.154.0: hooks/src/engine/discovery.rs hook_hash and
# normalize_command_hook, config/src/fingerprint.rs version_for_toml): the identity
#   {"event_name": <event key label>, "matcher": <matcher>, "hooks": [<handler>]}
# with the handler {"type", "command", "timeout", "async", "statusMessage",
# "additionalContextLimit"} where the command is exactly as written ($PLUGIN_ROOT is
# never expanded in it), the timeout is normalized (SessionEnd and Interrupt: default
# 1, clamped to 1..3; every other event: default 600, at least 1), async is as
# written, statusMessage and additionalContextLimit appear only when set, the
# matcher only for events that dispatch on one (not UserPromptSubmit, Stop,
# Interrupt), and absent values are omitted (TOML has no null). It is written as JSON
# with object keys sorted bytewise at every level, no whitespace and serde_json's
# string escaping; the hash is "sha256:" and the lowercase hex SHA-256 of those
# bytes. The comment above each line is that JSON, so
#   printf '%s' '<json>' | shasum -a 256
# reproduces the hash. These values were computed by an implementation independent
# of internal/harness/codex/trust.go; TestTrustHashesGolden requires trust.go to
# derive the same hashes from the shipped hooks file. A change to the declarations
# of hooks/codex.json updates this list (and codex-plugin.sha256) in the same
# reviewed change.
# {"event_name":"session_start","hooks":[{"async":false,"command":"sh \"$PLUGIN_ROOT/scripts/precinto-hook\" codex SessionStart","timeout":10,"type":"command"}],"matcher":"*"}
session_start:0:0  sha256:36d098b0440abc4aa57e3b29f1944ced8e5000a3f9eac8aeb2ca7d0e3b1866d6
# {"event_name":"user_prompt_submit","hooks":[{"async":false,"command":"sh \"$PLUGIN_ROOT/scripts/precinto-hook\" codex UserPromptSubmit","timeout":90,"type":"command"}]}
user_prompt_submit:0:0  sha256:dd46ac68c674c89fe14276fbdafc955969db4dc05522ed7bb18701be24c3963d
